# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Binaries, archives & crash dumps
# (release builds belong to GitHub Releases, not to the repository)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.msi
*.msix
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.dmp
*.mdmp
## Diagnostic traces and memory snapshots can contain decrypted secrets
*.etl
*.nettrace
*.gcdump
*.diagsession
*.speedscope.json

## Temp files / merge leftovers
_to_delete/
*.lnk
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej
*.swp
~$*

## Personal word lists dropped into Wordlists/ (only its README belongs to the repo)
Wordlists/*
!Wordlists/README.md

## Local launch profiles can contain machine-specific paths
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
